{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"bf60497d51334797ced5d877909cf510a7185ca7b5f36e6a912569510c512032","ja":"特訓開始！","zh":"开始特训！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"d5bb718a9ba1ec943aaabef7d657171eee13b2746b0d87e33279750a3f010edd","ja":"可憐さん♪\nダンスレッスン、お疲れ様でしたー！","zh":"可怜♪\n舞蹈课辛苦啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"46ba414885afe867c17de52e9f114af8e05dd6ee31350d08be557477a27d8286","ja":"お、お疲れ様……。\nあっ、もしかして……特訓？　えーっと……。","zh":"辛苦、辛苦了……\n啊，难道说……是在特训？那个……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"57bf5f900fc58561761090c9729e355c0532b0024019f29ef53f6db1cb6493d4","ja":"「ところで可憐さんは、今後アイドルとして\nどのような歌を歌っていきたいですか？」","zh":"「话说回来，可怜今后作为偶像，\n想要唱什么样的歌呢？」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0ff2a766db8f5d553b7cf7f1452cdd5d40f78ea0c74295ea35e91dc45b76815b","ja":"えっ、う、歌なの！？\nえっと、その……。","zh":"诶、要、要唱歌吗！？\n那个，这个……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7e1bbf437a2b04c27b196df9fa312a6e85a4d0d94d0910ce1f0f58d498605cf1","ja":"えへへ、レッスンの後で、ダンスの質問を警戒してそう\r\nでしたので、ちょっとイジワルしちゃいました。","zh":"嘿嘿，因为练习结束后，看起来好像很提防\n我会问舞蹈相关的问题，所以就稍微恶作剧了一下。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2e346a0d22864f31b5077bd4db4d21e22d20340721360aaaf05744d3f0592b88","ja":"でも、こういう質問は鉄板ネタですから！\n普段から考えておいても良いと思いますよっ！","zh":"不过，这种问题可是经典保留话题！\n我觉得平时也先想想比较好哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"848cf0d06e7b55afddfb855053d69044a8986bb362966c0d42c05cc4253fcd10","ja":"う、うん。ちょっと、身構えすぎちゃったね……。\nありがとう、亜利沙ちゃん。","zh":"嗯、嗯。我好像有点太紧绷了呢……\n谢谢你，亚利沙。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"b899322f8904a219934be35179207a8e6c9065c17d55aa551454aad894f64693","ja":"「本番直前にすみません！\n藍を演じる中で、大変だったことはありますか？」","zh":"“正式开演前打扰了！\n在饰演蓝的过程中，有什么感到辛苦的地方吗？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7fb02e5fd4e302a1b0428e121989bf15dbf75a12d4a1c0da6663cbdcacb476c3","ja":"もちろんです！　みんなで繋いできた役を\n引き継ぎながらも、自分なりに昇華させたり……。","zh":"那是当然的！不仅要传承大家一路维系至今的角色，\n还要以自己的方式去升华……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"3b925802b06992c1cdbbcf688fe01afff74f13816e7a34021f37021481e3353b","ja":"置かれた状況や関係も変わってきますから、\nその変化をどうやって見せるかも迷いましたし……。","zh":"所处的境遇和关系也会随之改变，\n该如何展现出这种变化也让人很伤脑筋……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"5e5567fbba6b77e1731f0b839c40645b32405b3fc058eae6874916d006f1642a","ja":"あと、それに……。","zh":"还有，那个……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"a18f2a131c4450ad50b64079fe4e912dcae2813367254285f908effcbb74af6e","ja":"ストーップ！　たくさん語りたい紗代子ちゃんの\nお気持ち、いちオタクとしてとてもわかります！","zh":"停——下！非常想倾诉很多很多的心情，\n作为一名宅，我非常懂小纱代子！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"a1758cef2a92944588ffab18f5b4ea7c9da017a64ed78eb2ea7f4b019239a172","ja":"わかりますが、もう少し短くしましょう！\n心苦しいですが、尺の都合がありますのでっ！","zh":"我能理解，但还是再缩短一点吧！\n虽然很遗憾，但毕竟有时长限制嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"a7b2526c973a91024d08177a7a550fa704375b9a512c096d1b435a7d21e6dfd5","ja":"ううっ。短くまとめたつもりだったんだけど、\nまだ長いんだね……。よーし、次こそは！","zh":"呜呜。明明本来打算精简一些的，\n结果还是太长了呀……好～，下次一定要成功！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"a7cb34220ef5249c3a87d141f1d4ae3f01f95ae59702c908c8d804f467422a54","ja":"特訓は続いて……","zh":"特训仍在继续……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"623f6df5e47d610de0dd2f456f744fe2e9a627dd831d34536bfce1768b73a1bc","ja":"「それでは、STARDOM ROADで\nご自分が演じた役について一言、お願いします！」","zh":"“那么，请对自己在这部STARDOM ROAD中\n饰演的角色说上一句吧！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"15e01f34a05e9ec5575d933fe75f80704b2b2868accbb51d3169d18000547cd7","ja":"とてもプロ意識が強くて、自分に自信を持っている\nクールで格好いい女の子、だと思います。","zh":"觉得她是一个专业意识非常强，对自己充满自信，\n既帅气又酷的女孩子。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"e7f6076648c835a38c6f640694bbfaa64b01477a9e8549c229b2fde42f652c8e","ja":"主人公である真珠星にとって、\n立ちふさがる壁でありライバルである子です！","zh":"对身为主角的真珠星来说，\n她是挡在前方的阻碍，也是宿命的对手！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1443.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"e4feb1d29e9bacc1dce47db3a3bc56ecbbb8763ad270f777f8a8ec489be4da21","ja":"すすす、素晴らしいです～！　この調子なら、\nあとはもう本番での実践を待つのみ、ですよぉ！","zh":"太太太、太精彩了～！照这个状态，\n之后就只等在正式演出中付诸实践了哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
